      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "25 August 2026 Current Affairs in Hindi & English\n\n➼ S. Somanath, Annie George Mathew, Janmejaya Kumar Sinha, Syed Akbaruddin और Anand Mahindra को RBI के Central Board में part-time non-official directors नियुक्त किया गया।\nS. Somanath, Annie George Mathew, Janmejaya Kumar Sinha, Syed Akbaruddin and Anand Mahindra were appointed as part-time non-official directors on the Central Board of RBI.\n\n➼ Panama-flagged cargo vessel MV Ocean Winner, जो Paradip Port से China के लिए iron ore ले जा रहा था, Bay of Bengal में डूब गया।\nPanama-flagged cargo vessel MV Ocean Winner, carrying iron ore from Paradip Port to China, sank in the Bay of Bengal.\n\n➼ Delhi Metro Rail Corporation (DMRC) Asset Management System के लिए ISO certification प्राप्त करने वाला भारत का पहला metro organisation बना।\nDMRC became the first metro organisation in India to receive ISO certification for its Asset Management System.\n\n➼ भारत के 12,000-HP electric freight locomotives Madhepura, Bihar में manufactured किए जाते हैं।\nIndia’s 12,000-HP electric freight locomotives are manufactured in Madhepura, Bihar.\n\n➼ BWF World Badminton Championships 2026 का Men’s Singles title Alex Lanier ने जीता।\nAlex Lanier won the Men’s Singles title at the BWF World Badminton Championships 2026.\n\n➼ Women’s Singles title An Se-young (South Korea) ने जीता।\nAn Se-young of South Korea won the Women’s Singles title.\n\n➼ Mixed Doubles gold medal French pair Thom Gicquel और Delphine Delrue ने जीता।\nFrench pair Thom Gicquel and Delphine Delrue won the Mixed Doubles gold medal.\n\n➼ East Bengal FC ने 135th Durand Cup 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nEast Bengal FC won the 135th edition of the Durand Cup 2026.\n\n➼ Haryana ने 16th Hockey India Junior Women’s National Championship (Division A) का खिताब जीता।\nHaryana won the 16th Hockey India Junior Women’s National Championship (Division A).\n\n➼ Indian leg-spinner Karn Sharma ने competitive cricket के सभी formats से retirement की घोषणा की।\nIndian leg-spinner Karn Sharma announced his retirement from all formats of competitive cricket.\n\n➼ Kanpur में UTT National-Ranking Table Tennis Tournament का Men’s Singles title Payas Jain (Delhi) ने जीता।\nPayas Jain of Delhi won the Men’s Singles title at the UTT National-Ranking Table Tennis Tournament in Kanpur.\n\n➼ Women’s Singles और Youth U-19 Girls’ titles Syndrela Das (West Bengal) ने जीते।\nSyndrela Das of West Bengal won the Women’s Singles and Youth U-19 Girls’ titles.\n\n➼ Formula 1 Dutch Grand Prix 2026 Lando Norris ने जीता।\nLando Norris won the Formula 1 Dutch Grand Prix 2026.\n\n➼ Sajjangarh Wildlife Sanctuary and Lion Safari राजस्थान में स्थित है।\nThe Sajjangarh Wildlife Sanctuary and Lion Safari is located in Rajasthan.\n\n➼ Uttar Pradesh के Imaliya Koder Tharu Tribal Museum, Balrampur को Indian Subcontinent Responsible Tourism Award 2026 के लिए चुना गया।\nThe Imaliya Koder Tharu Tribal Museum, Balrampur was selected for the Indian Subcontinent Responsible Tourism Award 2026.",
